Package: phonexfr
Title: French Phonetic Coding of Surnames with the Phonex Algorithm
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Jay", , "allanjay66@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-2905-3703")),
    person("Frederic", "Brouard", role = "cph",
           comment = "Auteur de l'algorithme Phonex")
  )
Description: Computes phonetic codes for French surnames with an adapted
    version of the Phonex algorithm by Frederic Brouard (1999)
    <https://sqlpro.developpez.com/cours/soundex/>, including corrections
    from earlier implementations. Names that sound alike receive the same
    code. The package was initially developed to link noisy historical
    databases despite spelling variations.
